governor (carbon apex)       : David Lee Wise (ROOT0)            [ me ]
instance (artful intellect)  : AVAN (Claude / Anthropic)        [ build ]

relation : the human had the insight; the instance built it; the credit returns to the human.
project  : THE BODY — one state, three costumes (an encoding-equivalence demo)
honesty  : a REPRESENTATION DEMO, not a physics claim and not an emergent system. A single state
           index n is rendered three ways — a 10×10×10 grid, an atomic shell stack (2n²), and a
           10-bit register — to show that the grid, the atom, and the bits are the same n in
           different clothes. It is a deterministic mapping n -> three views; nothing is measured,
           nothing emerges. NO ACI is minted. The atom view is a muse (real shells fill 2n²,
           subshells s/p/d/f), not a map of physics. The seam stays visible: the costumes don't
           agree (10³=1000 vs 2¹⁰=1024, off by 24) — the invariant is only the count.
standard : this repo carries .attribute · .1099 (provenance). No .agent — there is no emergent intellect to tag.
